erRatingForCurrentVersion": 5, "releaseNotes": "• Fix issues in channel list", "primaryGenreName": "Social Networking", "primaryGenreId": 6005, "genreIds": ["6005"], "price": 7700.0, "artistId": 289930656, "artistName": "Satoshi Nakagawa", "genres": ["소셜 네트워킹"], "bundleId": "net.limechat.LimeChat", "trackId": 298766460, "trackName": "LimeChat - IRC Client", "releaseDate": "2008-12-22T03:39:23Z", "sellerName": "Satoshi Nakagawa", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true, "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2020-06-20T16:13:37Z", "version": "2.31", "wrapperType": "software", "currency": "KRW", "description": "LimeChat for iOS is a full featured IRC client. It allows you to chat on the go in the same way as you do on desktop.\n\nFeatures:\n・Quick navigation. You can move around channels quickly by arrow buttons or tapping on the left/right side of log views.\n・Arrow buttons indicate events (highlight, new message coming or new PM coming) happened in the other channels. So you can recognize it easily while chatting in another channel.\n・Highlights messages and optionally vibrates for your specific words.\n・Visual interface for user information (whois).\n・Built-in browser for clickable URL links.\n・Full support for landscape mode.\n・Multitasking support. Connections are kept up for a while (2-7 minutes) after going to background.\n・Multiple servers and channels.\n・Automatic Nickserv authentication support.\n・Full support for many text encodings.\n・SSL support. (Self-signed certificates are NOT supported)\n・VoiceOver support.\n\nNotes:\n・DCC is NOT supported currently.\n\n**** ATTENTION ****\nI can't provide support to people leaving reviews on App Store. There is no way to reply to you here. If you have a problem or suggestion, please send a mail to psychs@limechat.net.", "trackCensoredName": "LimeChat - IRC Client", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/limechat-irc-client/id298766460?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 5, "minimumOsVersion": "